{"id":"n27373-1-22","stage":1,"title":"텔레비전 · 电视","scene":"居住与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n27373-1-22-1","ko":"그렇게 가까이에서 텔레비전 보면 눈 나빠진다.","zh":"离电视那么近看会伤眼睛的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그렇게","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그렇게","audio":"/audio/b470a873a66143d27846.mp3"}},{"text":"가까이에서","meaning":"近，靠近","explanation":"가까이：近，靠近；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"가까이","audio":"/audio/3eda613a715239a71379.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62494","senseId":"1","lemma":"가까이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가까이에서","audio":"/audio/6d00daaf95ddddeed5e6.mp3"}},{"text":"텔레비전","meaning":"电视，电视机","explanation":"텔레비전：电视，电视机。","readings":[{"term":"텔레비전","audio":"/audio/f5472a609d9fa7b0176c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27373","senseId":"1","lemma":"텔레비전","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"텔레비전","audio":"/audio/f5472a609d9fa7b0176c.mp3"}},{"text":"보면","meaning":"看，观看，观赏","explanation":"보다：看，观看，观赏；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"2","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보면","audio":"/audio/35629c9db8f201235337.mp3"}},{"text":"눈","meaning":"眼睛","explanation":"눈：眼睛。","readings":[{"term":"눈","audio":"/audio/ab1b14816087979d2143.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72704","senseId":"1","lemma":"눈","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"눈","audio":"/audio/ab1b14816087979d2143.mp3"}},{"text":"나빠진다.","meaning":"有害，不好；表示成为前面表达的状态。","explanation":"나쁘다：有害，不好；지다：表示成为前面表达的状态；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合；ㄴ다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"나쁘다","audio":"/audio/b67c592bde724aa15bfa.mp3"},{"term":"지다","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26816","senseId":"4","lemma":"나쁘다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"77247","senseId":"3","lemma":"지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나빠진다","audio":"/audio/b6052c2e368031d72633.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"3eda613a715239a7","term":"가까이","zh":"近，靠近","audio":"/audio/3eda613a715239a71379.mp3","entryId":"62494","definition":"距离不远地。","pronunciation":["가까이"]},{"id":"f5472a609d9fa7b0","term":"텔레비전","zh":"电视，电视机","audio":"/audio/f5472a609d9fa7b0176c.mp3","entryId":"27373","definition":"接收电视台以电波传送的图像与声音后使其显示出来的机器。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看，观看，观赏","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"用眼睛享受或欣赏某个对象。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"ab1b14816087979d","term":"눈","zh":"眼睛","audio":"/audio/ab1b14816087979d2143.mp3","entryId":"72704","definition":"人或动物的一种感觉器官，位于脸部，受光线刺激后能看到物体。","pronunciation":["눈"]},{"id":"b67c592bde724aa1","term":"나쁘다","zh":"有害，不好","audio":"/audio/b67c592bde724aa15bfa.mp3","entryId":"26816","definition":"不利于健康。","pronunciation":["나쁘다"]},{"id":"6fde84679c7f2c31","term":"지다","zh":"表示成为前面表达的状态。","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3","entryId":"77247","definition":"表示成为前面表达的状态。","pronunciation":["지다"]}],"audio":"/audio/225064edec94671c1418.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n27373-1-22-2","ko":"네, 뒤로 가서 볼게요.","zh":"好的，我往后退一点看。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"네：是，行。","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"2","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}},{"text":"뒤로","meaning":"后，后面","explanation":"뒤：后，后面；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"뒤","audio":"/audio/c65326b2de936236c222.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67477","senseId":"1","lemma":"뒤","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뒤로","audio":"/audio/2df06869205b07fef47d.mp3"}},{"text":"가서","meaning":"去，上","explanation":"가다：去，上；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"6","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가서","audio":"/audio/0a4296790d3f4b0e6e6b.mp3"}},{"text":"볼게요.","meaning":"表示有意去做前面的话语所指的行动。","explanation":"보다：表示有意去做前面的话语所指的行动；ㄹ게요：向对方礼貌地表达自己的决定或承诺。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62249","senseId":"2","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"볼게요","audio":"/audio/2cd0ea99474da1b2d1a0.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"17294","definition":"用于肯定回答长辈所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["네"]},{"id":"c65326b2de936236","term":"뒤","zh":"后，后面","audio":"/audio/c65326b2de936236c222.mp3","entryId":"67477","definition":"朝向的反方向。","pronunciation":["뒤ː"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去，上","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"为某种目的而向某个地方移动。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"表示有意去做前面的话语所指的行动。","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62249","definition":"表示有意去做前面的话语所指的行动。","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/4cdb6acc4be3154e6bb3.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.12,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=27373","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":36,"sequenceScore":1.5707,"questions":[{"lineIndex"